Sound card for a MAX98357A I2S amplifier on I2S2 of the Milk-V Duo 256M
(sound/soc/cvitek/cv1835_max98357a.c, with its Kconfig and Makefile entries).

Applies to duo-buildroot-sdk-v2 (git apply, from the SDK's top directory);
build_boot_sd.sh applies it. See docs/milkv-duo.md, "I2S amplifier (MAX98357A)"
in TinyTTS.

